keymasq (0.8.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add native cursor positioning for GNOME and X11 so absolute pointer moves
    can use desktop-aware positioning paths on those sessions.
  * Improve GNOME bridge probing across more gsettings layouts and expand VM
    coverage for native cursor-setting flows.
  * Clarify Fedora Atomic and Bazzite RPM install troubleshooting for the
    native RPM packaging path.

